    kind of project?\",\"parentUIDs\":[8],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":13}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":269.6667,\"yPos\":100.666687},\"ID\":12,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Leave
