    you again! Hey, don't run away!\",\"parentUIDs\":[],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Enola\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":7}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":149.999985,\"yPos\":-206.000015},\"ID\":6,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"I'm
    not taking much. Just a few. I didn\u2019t know they belonged to anyone.\",\"parentUIDs\":[0],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"...\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":8}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":150.999985,\"yPos\":-105.000015},\"ID\":7,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"They
    do.\",\"parentUIDs\":[6],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Enola\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":11},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":12}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":152.999985,\"yPos\":-1.52587891E-05},\"ID\":8,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Okay.
    I\u2019m sorry. I really am. I needed them for a project.\",\"parentUIDs\":[7],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"...\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":16}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":271.6667,\"yPos\":173.666687},\"ID\":13,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Leave
    the basket. Then see that you get home.\",\"parentUIDs\":[12],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Enola\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":15}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":37.66664,\"yPos\":179.666687},\"ID\":14,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"What
    kind of project?\",\"parentUIDs\":[11],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Enola\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":42.66667,\"yPos\":290.666626},\"ID\":15,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"It
